<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#101827"><meta name="description" content="理科・社会の重要問題演習とマーク式模試。"><link rel="manifest" href="/study.webmanifest"><link rel="icon" href="/study-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><title>KNOT Study｜理科・社会</title><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(appData)}></script><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0b1220;color:#eef3fb}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% -20%,#1d3558 0,transparent 55%),#0b1220;min-height:100vh}main{width:min(980px,92vw);margin:auto;padding:36px 0 64px}.brand{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#9db2ce;font-weight:800}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:42px 0 8px}h1 span{color:#70a7ff}.lead{color:#aebbd0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8}.pills{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0 34px}.pill{border:1px solid #34445d;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 12px;color:#c5d2e4;font-size:12px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px}.card{background:#141f30;border:1px solid #2b3b53;border-radius:18px;padding:22px;min-height:185px}.card h2{margin:8px 0;font-size:22px}.card p{color:#aebbd0;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}a.action,button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:12px 17px;background:#77aaff;color:#081323;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.secondary{background:#26364d!important;color:#e8f0fc!important}.foot{margin-top:28px;color:#7f91aa;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:560px){main{padding-top:24px}.card{min-height:0}}
</style></head><body><main><div class="brand">KNOT / LEARNING</div><h1>KNOT Study<span>.</span></h1><p class="lead">理科と社会を、知識だけで終わらせない。<br>資料を読み、考え、マークして解く。</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">理科・社会に特化</span><span class="pill">3段階の難易度</span><span class="pill">学習記録は端末に保存</span><span class="pill">ホーム画面に追加可能</span></div><section class="grid">
<article class="card"><div>⚗️ SCIENCE</div><h2>理科</h2><p>物理・化学・生物・地学。基礎から入試応用まで段階的に演習。</p><a class="action" href="/study/solve/?subject=science">理科を学習する →</a></article>
<article class="card"><div>🌏 SOCIAL STUDIES</div><h2>社会</h2><p>地理・歴史・公民。用語暗記に加え、地図・統計・史料の読解にも挑戦。</p><a class="action" href="/study/solve/?subject=social">社会を学習する →</a></article>
<article class="card"><div>📝 MOCK EXAM</div><h2>もしもーど</h2><p>マーク式の模擬テスト。解答を提出してから自動採点と解説を確認。</p><a class="action secondary" href="/study/solve/?mode=mock">模試を始める →</a></article>
<article class="card"><div>📊 MY RECORD</div><h2>学習記録</h2><p>解答数・正答率・間違えた問題をこの端末に保存して振り返る。</p><a class="action secondary" href="/study/solve/?mode=review">復習する →</a></article></section><p class="foot">KNOT STUDY · 学習用Webアプリ / <a href="/" style="color:#9db2ce">KNOTブログへ戻る</a></p></main><script>if('serviceWorker'in navigator)addEventListener('load',()=>navigator.serviceWorker.register('/study-sw.js',{scope:'/study/'}).catch(()=>{}));let d;window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt',e=>{e.preventDefault();d=e;const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent='アプリをインストール';b.style.marginTop='18px';b.onclick=async()=>{d.prompt();await d.userChoice;d=null;b.remove()};document.querySelector('main').append(b)});</script></body></html>